  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper reports three main evaluated quantum applications: QLSTM forecasting with RMSE 1.82, MAE 1.45, and MSE 3.31; QSVM robustness with only 11.67% FGSM and 15.60% PGD accuracy drops; and QKD security with SKR 5.87 bps, Shannon entropy 0.99, and 102.90 years estimated resistance to quantum attacks. It also discusses two additional quantum methods that were missed in the extraction: QGAF+CNN for stock return prediction (25% MAE reduction, 48% MSE reduction) and QFNN-FFD for fraud detection (95% accuracy).",
